          "type": "string",
          "description": "**参数解释**:hyper cluster的ID。\n**取值范围**:^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$。",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
